    "updated_at": "2021-07-29T09:15:56Z",
    "body": "Yes this is not currently well defined in the spec. We're working on the inheritance problem as part of the [PolicyContainer](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/origin.html#policy-container) effort. We do plan to move COOP to be in the PolicyContainer, and integrate it with the COOP check during navigate a fetch. This should spec the inheritance of COOP as expected in the WPT test. The behavior of the WPT is really what we want to have at the end.",
